**Describe the bug**

When i run the test with two workers, first spec file test case failed, worker is closed, while second spec file is still running. After second spec file is completed successfully, new context is created and spec file one is executed. What i noticed is if a test case fails, the spec file is stalled from further execution until all the other workers succeed.

Kindly let me know if my understanding is incorrect the way it's expected to work.
